&lt;p&gt;As Anthropic&#39;s Data Center Security Operations Lead , you will own day-to-day physical security operations across our data center campuses in the area, including sites run with operating partners. You will be the person on the ground: the one who knows each site, its guard force, its local responders and what is actually happening on the floor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on individual contributor role with no direct reports. You&#39;ll be on-site most weeks and get things done through people and companies you don&#39;t manage: site operators, guard vendors, construction and infrastructure partners, and your colleagues on the Data Center Security Engineering team. You will have the authority to make operational calls at your sites, and you&#39;ll work with the team&#39;s systems and delivery roles to take over each new site as it moves into operation.&lt;/p&gt;
